{"4598190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fill The Void", "steam_appid": 4598190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start Small. Suck Things Up. Grow into a World-Eating Black Hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Fill The Void' is a physics-driven incremental 3D platforming collectathon where you play as a black hole. Collect everything in the universe, play online or locally with friends, and even create your own levels!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/57bcd710e4e342ffd614ed4c702298b4.poster.avif?t=1788306059\" width=1170 height=916 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/57bcd710e4e342ffd614ed4c702298b4.webm?t=1788306059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/57bcd710e4e342ffd614ed4c702298b4.mp4?t=1788306059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>GAMEPLAY &amp; OBJECTIVE:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Consume everything in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Slide across surfaces or transform into a physics-based sphere to roll around and knock things over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fill your collectible gallery with all the objects you've collected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Purchase upgrades that make your black hole more powerful and look different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Every level is a themed diorama packed with things that are about to be consumed. Butterfly sanctuaries. Bowling alleys. Coconut orchards. Underwater casinos. Hibachi joints. Each one is rendered in a distinctive visual style, with unique collectible items that make up the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/dc395412107886b744c5b39d5a623d18.poster.avif?t=1788306059\" width=1170 height=916 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/dc395412107886b744c5b39d5a623d18.webm?t=1788306059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/dc395412107886b744c5b39d5a623d18.mp4?t=1788306059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INCREMENTAL UNLOCKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consume collectibles to gain credits. Spend these on new abilities like double jump and wall jump, new upgrades like increasing gravitational pull, buy new skins, and unlock new levels to grow more and continue the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/999adc15d919204f34e4fff5d58920cc.poster.avif?t=1788306059\" width=1170 height=916 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/999adc15d919204f34e4fff5d58920cc.webm?t=1788306059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/999adc15d919204f34e4fff5d58920cc.mp4?t=1788306059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONLINE &amp; LOCAL MULTIPLAYER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with or against a friend, each with custom skins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/5110f7063d80922647d2abb3088c734b.poster.avif?t=1788306059\" width=1170 height=916 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/5110f7063d80922647d2abb3088c734b.webm?t=1788306059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/5110f7063d80922647d2abb3088c734b.mp4?t=1788306059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress your black hole in your favorite skin, and work together in co-op mode to consume everything in the level. Or, go head-to-head in versus mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/e35fa3eda12cbf87abd0ef2d3da32a03.poster.avif?t=1788306059\" width=1170 height=916 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/e35fa3eda12cbf87abd0ef2d3da32a03.webm?t=1788306059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/e35fa3eda12cbf87abd0ef2d3da32a03.mp4?t=1788306059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEVEL CREATOR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own little worlds to destroy!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/3b4c4cbcabfc94e58c91bfeba5cfc455.poster.avif?t=1788306059\" width=1170 height=916 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/3b4c4cbcabfc94e58c91bfeba5cfc455.webm?t=1788306059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/3b4c4cbcabfc94e58c91bfeba5cfc455.mp4?t=1788306059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start Small. Suck Things Up. Grow into a World-Eating Black Hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Fill The Void' is a physics-driven incremental 3D platforming collectathon where you play as a black hole. Collect everything in the universe, play online or locally with friends, and even create your own levels!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/57bcd710e4e342ffd614ed4c702298b4.poster.avif?t=1788306059\" width=1170 height=916 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/57bcd710e4e342ffd614ed4c702298b4.webm?t=1788306059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/57bcd710e4e342ffd614ed4c702298b4.mp4?t=1788306059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>GAMEPLAY &amp; OBJECTIVE:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Consume everything in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Slide across surfaces or transform into a physics-based sphere to roll around and knock things over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fill your collectible gallery with all the objects you've collected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Purchase upgrades that make your black hole more powerful and look different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Every level is a themed diorama packed with things that are about to be consumed. Butterfly sanctuaries. Bowling alleys. Coconut orchards. Underwater casinos. Hibachi joints. Each one is rendered in a distinctive visual style, with unique collectible items that make up the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/dc395412107886b744c5b39d5a623d18.poster.avif?t=1788306059\" width=1170 height=916 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/dc395412107886b744c5b39d5a623d18.webm?t=1788306059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/dc395412107886b744c5b39d5a623d18.mp4?t=1788306059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INCREMENTAL UNLOCKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consume collectibles to gain credits. Spend these on new abilities like double jump and wall jump, new upgrades like increasing gravitational pull, buy new skins, and unlock new levels to grow more and continue the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/999adc15d919204f34e4fff5d58920cc.poster.avif?t=1788306059\" width=1170 height=916 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/999adc15d919204f34e4fff5d58920cc.webm?t=1788306059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/999adc15d919204f34e4fff5d58920cc.mp4?t=1788306059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONLINE &amp; LOCAL MULTIPLAYER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with or against a friend, each with custom skins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598190/extras/5110f7063d80922647d2abb3088c734b.poster.avif?t=1788306059\" width=1170 height=916 ><source src=\"https: